niihan_construction_site.sdf adapts construction_site_procedural.sdf supplied in
NIiihan_surveillance_rover_old/surveillance_robot_ws_workspace_lint_clean/src/surveillance_robot_gazebo.
The supplied NOTICE identifies Im-praj/niihan_ws commit
e2c2efc09780dfbf78e2c6ae59883ff8cb6b82a1 as the procedural scene source
